# Experiment 12: Workflow Orchestration Using Apache Airflow

## DAG Details
- DAG ID: food_delivery_etl
- Schedule: Every 15 minutes
- Cron expression: */15 * * * *

## Tasks
1. validate_clean_load
2. data_quality_report

## Purpose
Automates ETL validation and data quality reporting.

## Execution Results
The Airflow interface displayed 11 successful DAG runs.
Both tasks succeeded in the observed run.

The validation task reported 0 staged orders in the
captured run. The quality report showed 563 good
records and 40 rejected records from the earlier ETL results.

